# ==============================================================================
# EduTrack Monorepo — Root Docker Build Context Exclusions
# Applies to every `docker build` in this repo (build context = repo root).
#
# Keep in mind: apps/backend/Dockerfile and apps/web_app/Dockerfile both use a
# Turborepo "pruner" stage that needs the FULL workspace graph (every
# package.json + pnpm-lock.yaml + pnpm-workspace.yaml + turbo.json + source of
# every workspace member) to compute `turbo prune`. Do NOT exclude workspace
# manifests, TypeScript configs, or app/package source directories here.
# ==============================================================================

# ---- Version control -------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github

# ---- Dependencies / package manager stores ---------------------------------
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm-store
# Stray npm lockfiles — pnpm-lock.yaml at the root is the only source of truth
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock

# ---- Build outputs (rebuilt fresh inside every image) ----------------------
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
.turbo
**/.turbo
.next
**/.next

# ---- Expo / React Native generated artifacts (mobile is never containerized)
.expo
**/.expo
expo-env.d.ts
**/expo-env.d.ts
**/android
**/ios
**/.gradle

# ---- Environment files / credentials (never baked into an image) ----------
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# ---- Logs --------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
**/*.log
**/logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---- Editor / IDE / local tooling metadata ---------------------------------
.idea
.vscode
.serena
.claude
.agents
.eslintcache

# ---- Docs, audits, tests, and other non-build artifacts (safe to exclude) --
docs
testing
audit
auth-migration
Workflows
examples
postman
apps/*/docs
*.md
**/*.md

# ---- Deployment configs for other targets (irrelevant inside the image) ----
render.yaml
netlify.toml

# ---- Misc top-level assets not needed to build backend/web -----------------
assets
EduTrack_logo.png

# ---- OS metadata files ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
